l casts affected one another without ever meeting. This would mean that no actors needed to be retained for the full four-week shoot except for Pertwee and Manning themselves, who would be the only characters ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.eruditorumpress.com/blog/a-mild-curiosity-in-a-junkyard-silence-in-the-library-the-forest-of-the-dead\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d79\"},\"ref\":\"d79\",\"snippet\":\" ... This featured all the actors who had played the Doctor to that time (although Hartnell and Tom Baker were shown in stock footage). It also was a first in the act of recasting the main actors as Richard Hurndall was cast in the role of the First Doctor ... \",\"title\":\"https://tardis.fandom.com/wiki/Doctor_Who\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d80\"},\"ref\":\"d80\",\"snippet\":\" ... character to seduce a virginal society girl (Uma Thuman) betrothed to Close's ex-lover.\\n\\nMalkovich's character would get to that, eventually, but first, he's off to bed with the married character played by Michelle Pfeiffer. Life imitated art, as Malkovich and Pfeiffer had a real ... \",\"title\":\"https://familyminded.com/s/movies-ended-divorce-celebrity-couples-910fccfeff094145\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d81\"},\"ref\":\"d81\",\"snippet\":\" ... Todd claims William Wyler offered him the lead in The Collector but the actor felt he was miscast and persuaded him not to cast him. \\\"It was not the first time that I had talked myself out of a picture — there had been The Guns of Navarone, League ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Richard_Todd\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or