 music charts, thanks to her children's band. Jones' real-life stepson David Cassidy also starred as the group's lead singer ... \",\"title\":\"https://tv.apple.com/us/person/shirley-jones/umc.cpc.3qho2ywpnntcts8jp4xj0qwft\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d85\"},\"ref\":\"d85\",\"snippet\":\" ... The key character of Mike Karr on The Edge of Night was played by three actors.\\n\\nConversely, several actors have remained playing the same character for many years, or decades even. Helen Wagner played Hughes family matriarch Nancy Hughes on American soap As the World Turns from its ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Soap_opera\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d86\"},\"ref\":\"d86\",\"snippet\":\" ... Lee Harrington (eds) The Survival of Soap Opera: Transformatio (...)\\n\\n3Obviously, the genre issue is much more complex. When one explores the literature on the emergence and development of other television serials around the world, like the \\\"soap opera\\\", \\\"primetime TV drama\\\", \\\"telenovela\\\" or \\\"musalsal2,\\\" they all point: (1 ... \",\"title\":\"https://journals.openedition.org/tvseries/2406\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d87\"},\"ref\":\"d87\",\"snippet\":\" ... Brazilian telenovelas often have convoluted subplots involving three or four different settings. Usually, there is a rich setting, a poor setting and one or more settings in which the characters of both settings can interact. There is no clear-cut line between \\\"good\\\" and \\\"evil\\\" characters, with protagonists ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Telenovela\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navi